{"parse": {"title": "4TH-23", "pageid": 6123, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-22\" title=\"4TH-22\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">4TH-23</span><a href=\"/wiki/5TH-01\" title=\"5TH-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">4TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">23</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BB.8A.E6.97.B6.E5.BE.80.E6.97.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"今时往日\">今时往日</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 今时往日</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Old Days Once More</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>硬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>奶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>油<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>许<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>属<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>今<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>柔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>软<span class=\"color-value\"></span>轻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>盈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>陌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>生<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10423</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都尘埃落定了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>日子将像水自东流般平铺直叙地淌过。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>没错，是这样。嗯，我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我明天答复你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士与往日一样，回到自己办公室的门前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一次，沉浸在事程规划的秘书抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秘书莎朗：</div><div>Z女士，请稍等。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将一个小方盒递过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秘书莎朗：</div><div>副会长要我把这个交给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……她有说什么原因吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秘书莎朗：</div><div>没有，她没特别说明缘由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莎朗在原地想了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秘书莎朗：</div><div>哦，她好像提了一句……今天是农历九月十一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>知道了。帮我传达一下谢意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莎朗点点头，安静地回到了自己的办公区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士低头看着手中的方盒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一股淡淡的，小叶紫檀的香气在空气中飘浮着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是崭新的黑白棋子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>里面附有一张短小的贺函。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>“很高兴见证了你的成长。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-501211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士平静地将盒盖合上，放进口袋里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打开门，进入了办公室。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士环视了一圈办公室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一间普通且适用的房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四周放了规章文件、学术期刊、日程表，还有一张置于镜旁的老照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在镜中看到了自己的脸。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_jingzhongdez.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_jingzhongdez\"><img alt=\"at_jingzhongdez\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-at_jingzhongdez.png/600px-Cg-at_jingzhongdez.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-at_jingzhongdez.png/900px-Cg-at_jingzhongdez.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/Cg-at_jingzhongdez.png/1200px-Cg-at_jingzhongdez.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>比起那张黑白照片中的少女，如今镜中人的轮廓变得更加分明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——白鹿会成为猛虎吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她捋了捋头发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>留着及肩的长辫的日子，仿佛尚在眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将短短的发尾分为三束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>左趋右，交叉，右趋左，交叉，复系之。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>辫子翘了起来，就像不合时宜的羊尾辫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>呵呵……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士打开冰柜，在冷色的光照下捧出一块白色的蛋糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻轻一拉灯绳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋内恢复了最初的静谧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祝你生日快乐，祝你生日快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祝你幸福祝你健康，祝你前途光明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "4TH-23"}}